From: shuios <dev@shuios.local>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] frontend: do not build the IBus frontend

shuios has no IBus clients: GTK apps use the fcitx5-gtk immodule over
D-Bus and Wayland clients use the waylandim frontend. Building
ibusfrontend also hits a GCC 13.4.0 internal compiler error while
expanding the coroutine in gnomeappmonitor.cpp.

---
--- a/src/frontend/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/frontend/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -13,5 +13,7 @@
 if (ENABLE_DBUS)
     add_subdirectory(dbusfrontend)
     add_subdirectory(fcitx4frontend)
-    add_subdirectory(ibusfrontend)
+    # shuios：不构建 IBus 前端。系统里没有 IBus 客户端（GTK 走 fcitx5-gtk
+    # immodule，Wayland 原生应用走 waylandim），且它的协程代码会触发
+    # GCC 13.4.0 的 internal compiler error（build_special_member_call）。
 endif()
